  "content_id": "16136236",
  "title": "Solana Network Fees",
  "description": "Solana Network – Blazing Speed at Tiny Costs\nSolana is built for high-performance applications and is known for processing thousands of tr...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ29V2EJ7T2ZPEV2XQRGY9F\">Solana Network – Blazing Speed at Tiny Costs</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Solana is built for <b>high-performance applications</b> and is known for processing thousands of transactions per second at extremely low fees.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ29V2EJVH8C2BJG1SW88V5\">How Solana Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are determined by:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network usage</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction type (simple send, smart contract interaction, etc.)</b><br>Fees are paid in <b>SOL tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge checks Solana’s real-time network conditions and suggests the right fee for your transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ29V2E0EAEEHRTBX5ZF18C\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Prioritizes very fast execution</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Best everyday choice</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest but could be slightly delayed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full manual control for advanced users</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ29V2E137NDP9XJSCAA3B6\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">A standard Solana transaction costs <b>less than $0.001 USD</b>—fractions of a cent!</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ29V2EBA4Y3P1T88SN1TK8\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Solana enables rapid and cheap blockchain interactions, ideal for DeFi, NFTs, and gaming. Edge Wallet simplifies Solana fee handling so you can stay fast and flexible without overcomplicating your send.</p><hr>",
